ergy, and industrials (e.g. XCUUSD copper, USOUSD WTI, NATGAS). Volume may be 0 for instruments without a reported tick count. When `start` predates upstream coverage the API returns `422` with code `data_unavailable` and an `earliest` field carrying the first date it can serve. Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Commodities"],"parameters":[{"name":"symbol","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Commodity code (4-12 upper alphanumerics), e.g. `XAUUSD`, `XCUUSD`.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"XAUUSD"},{"name":"start","in":"query","required":true,"description":"Inclusive lower bound (YYYY-MM-DD or RFC3339). Required.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"2026-11-01"},{"name":"end","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Inclusive upper bound. Default now.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"interval","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Bar interval. Default 1m. Full set: intraday (1m–1h), `1d` (daily candle with a true session boundary), `1w` (Monday-aligned), and `1mo` (calendar month), all aggregated from 1-minute history.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["1m","5m","15m","30m","1h","1d","1w","1mo"],"default":"1m"},"example":"1h"},{"name":"order","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Sort direction by time. `asc` (default) returns oldest→newest. `desc` returns newest→oldest and anchors the first page at the most recent bar, so fetching the latest N costs one request instead of paging the whole window. Supported on commodities and forex only; other historical routes are ascending-only.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["asc","desc"],"default":"asc"},"example":"asc"},{"name":"cursor","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Opaque pagination cursor from a previous response's `meta.next_cursor`.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":1000,"maximum":2000},"example":1000},{"name":"Accept-Encoding","in":"header","required":false,"description":"Recommended: large responses are only served gzip-compressed.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["gzip"]}}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.01"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"t":{"type":"integer"},"o":{"type":"number"},"h":{"type":"number"},"l":{"type":"number"},"c":{"type":"number"},"v":{"type":"number"}}}},"meta":{"type":"object","properties":{"as_of":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"next_cursor":{"type":"string"},"symbol":{"type":"string"},"interval":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/hist/crypto/{symbol}/bars":{"get":{"operationId":"getCryptoBars","summary":"Historical crypto OHLCV bars (gzip required)","description":"Historical crypto OHLCV bars (gzip required). Requires `Accept-Encoding: gzip`. When `start` predates all upstreams' coverage the API returns `422` with code `data_unavailable` and an `earliest` field. Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Crypto"],"parameters":[{"name":"symbol","in":"path","required":true,"description":"USD-quoted crypto symbol, e.g. `BTCUSD`.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"BTCUSD"},{"name":"start","in":"query","required":true,"description":"Inclusive lower bound (YYYY-MM-DD or RFC3339). Required.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"2026-11-01"},{"name":"end","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Inclusive upper bound. Default now.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"interval","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Bar interval. Default 1m. All `/v1/hist/*` routes accept the same set: intraday (1m–1h), plus `1d` (UTC calendar day), `1w` (Monday-aligned), and `1mo` (calendar month). Coarser bars are aggregated from 1-minute history; a `1d`/`1w`/`1mo` bar opens at midnight UTC of the period start.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["1m","5m","15m","30m","1h","1d","1w","1mo"],"default":"1m"},"example":"1h"},{"name":"cursor","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Opaque pagination cursor from a previous response's `meta.next_cursor`.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":1000,"maximum":5000},"example":1000},{"name":"Accept-Encoding","in":"header","required":false,"description":"Recommended: large responses are only served gzip-compressed.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["gzip"]}}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.01"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"t":{"type":"integer"},"o":{"type":"number"},"h":{"type":"number"},"l":{"type":"number"},"c":{"type":"number"},"v":{"type":"number"}}}},"meta":{"type":"object","properties":{"as_of":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"next_cursor":{"type":"string"},"symbol":{"type":"string"},"interval":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/hist/forex/{pair}/bars":{"get":{"operationId":"getForexBars","summary":"Historical forex OHLC bars (gzip required)","description":"Historical forex OHLC bars (gzip required). Requires `Accept-Encoding: gzip`. `v` is a per-bar tick count where the upstream reports one, else 0. When `start` predates upstream coverage the API returns `422` with code `data_unavailable` and an `earliest` field carrying the first date it can serve. Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Forex"],"parameters":[{"name":"pair","in":"path","required":true,"description":"DEX pair (TOKEN0-TOKEN1) or FX pair (e.g. EURUSD).","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"USDTRY"},{"name":"start","in":"query","required":true,"description":"Inclusive lower bound (YYYY-MM-DD or RFC3339). Required.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"2026-11-01"},{"name":"end","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Inclusive upper bound. Default now.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"interval","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Bar interval. Default 1m. All `/v1/hist/*` routes accept the same set: intraday (1m–1h), plus `1d` (UTC calendar day), `1w` (Monday-aligned), and `1mo` (calendar month). Coarser bars are aggregated from 1-minute history; a `1d`/`1w`/`1mo` bar opens at midnight UTC of the period start.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["1m","5m","15m","30m","1h","1d","1w","1mo"],"default":"1m"},"example":"1h"},{"name":"order","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Sort direction by time. `asc` (default) returns oldest→newest. `desc` returns newest→oldest and anchors the first page at the most recent bar, so fetching the latest N costs one request instead of paging the whole window. Supported on commodities and forex only; other historical routes are ascending-only.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["asc","desc"],"default":"asc"},"example":"asc"},{"name":"cursor","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Opaque pagination cursor from a previous response's `meta.next_cursor`.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":1000,"maximum":2000},"example":1000},{"name":"Accept-Encoding","in":"header","required":false,"description":"Recommended: large responses are only served gzip-compressed.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["gzip"]}}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.01"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"t":{"type":"integer"},"o":{"type":"number"},"h":{"type":"number"},"l":{"type":"number"},"c":{"type":"number"},"v":{"type":"number"}}}},"meta":{"type":"object","properties":{"as_of":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"next_cursor":{"type":"string"},"symbol":{"type":"string"},"interval":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/hist/stocks/{ticker}/bars":{"get":{"operationId":"getStockBars","summary":"Historical stock OHLCV bars (gzip required)","description":"Historical stock OHLCV bars (gzip required). Requires `Accept-Encoding: gzip`. All intervals (1m through 1mo) cover regular-session bars back to 2000, ascending (oldest first; page forward with `cursor`). `1d` is one US trading session, `1w` is Monday-aligned, `1mo` is a calendar month. Prices are as-traded (not adjusted for splits or dividends). Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Stocks"],"parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"description":"US equity ticker (case-insensitive).","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"AAPL"},{"name":"start","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Inclusive lower bound (YYYY-MM-DD or RFC3339).","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"2026-11-01"},{"name":"end","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Inclusive upper bound. Default now.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"interval","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Bar interval. Default 1m. Stocks additionally support `1d`, `1w` (Monday-aligned), and `1mo` (calendar month), all aggregated from the same 1-minute history back to 2000. Prices are as-traded (not split/dividend adjusted). A `1d`/`1w`/`1mo` bar opens at midnight UTC of the period start.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["1m","5m","15m","30m","1h","1d","1w","1mo"],"default":"1m"},"example":"1d"},{"name":"cursor","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Opaque pagination cursor from a previous response's `meta.next_cursor`.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":1000,"maximum":1000},"example":1000},{"name":"Accept-Encoding","in":"header","required":false,"description":"Recommended: large responses are only served gzip-compressed.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["gzip"]}}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.01"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"t":{"type":"integer"},"o":{"type":"number"},"h":{"type":"number"},"l":{"type":"number"},"c":{"type":"number"},"v":{"type":"number"}}}},"meta":{"type":"object","properties":{"as_of":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"next_cursor":{"type":"string"},"symbol":{"type":"string"},"interval":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/fnd/symbols/{asset_class}/{symbol}":{"get":{"operationId":"getFundamentalSymbol","summary":"Get instrument details (fundamentals alias)","description":"Get instrument details (fundamentals alias). Look up a stock, crypto, forex or commodity catalog entry using its asset class and symbol, for example `/v1/fnd/symbols/stocks/AAPL`. The asset class is normalized to lowercase and the symbol to uppercase. Inactive and delisted entries can also be returned. For DEX instruments, use the detail path with a separate chain segment. Normal API-key authentication and usage limits ap… Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Symbols"],"parameters":[{"name":"asset_class","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Asset-class segment of the catalog slug; case-insensitive.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["stocks","crypto","forex","commodities"]},"example":"forex"},{"name":"symbol","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Symbol segment returned by the catalog, normalized to uppercase. Encode this segment separately from the slash-delimited slug.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"USDTRY"}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.002"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"type":"object","description":"Instrument reference metadata. Optional string fields are omitted when unavailable. Catalog status does not establish the availability or freshness of live prices or historical bars.","required":["slug","asset_class","venue","symbol","status","details"],"properties":{"slug":{"type":"string","description":"Canonical identifier with literal slash separators: asset_class/symbol, or dex/chain/symbol for DEX. Encode segments separately when building a detail URL."},"asset_class":{"type":"string","enum":["stocks","crypto","forex","commodities"]},"venue":{"type":"string","description":"Venue tag stored in the catalog."},"market_id":{"type":"string","description":"Market identifier, when mapped."},"symbol":{"type":"string","description":"Canonical instrument symbol."},"name":{"type":"string"},"base_asset":{"type":"string"},"quote_asset":{"type":"string"},"currency":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["active","inactive","delisted"]},"details":{"type":"object","description":"Asset-specific metadata; an empty object when unavailable.","additionalProperties":true}}},"meta":{"type":"object","required":["as_of"],"properties":{"as_of":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"Response generation time, not the underlying market data timestamp."}}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/last/close/{venue}/{symbol}":{"get":{"operationId":"getLastClose","summary":"Previous close","description":"Previous close. The most recent previous close for one instrument. For crypto/forex/ commodities this is the engine's fair price frozen at the last 00:00 UTC boundary; for stocks it is the official exchange session close. The response is immutable until the next close, so it is edge-cacheable (Cache-Control max-age expires at the next boundary) unlike the live trade/quote reads. Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Live"],"parameters":[{"name":"venue","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Market venue for previous close. DEX has no previous-close product; commodities does (unlike the live trade/quote venues).","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["stocks","crypto","forex","commodities"]},"example":"crypto"},{"name":"symbol","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Symbol, normalized to the venue's canonical form.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"BTCUSD"}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.005"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"s":{"type":"string","description":"Symbol."},"c":{"type":"string","description":"Close price."},"d":{"type":"string","description":"UTC close date, YYYY-MM-DD."},"t":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Close-boundary Unix epoch milliseconds."}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/last/eod/{venue}/{symbol}":{"get":{"operationId":"getLastEod","summary":"End-of-day bar","description":"End-of-day bar. The previous completed trading day's daily (1d) OHLCV bar for one instrument, bounded at 00:00 UTC — one call, no window/interval/cursor. The current, still-forming day is always excluded, so the value is stable within the day; on a weekend or holiday it returns the last session that traded (e.g. Friday's bar on a Sunday) rather than an empty result. Immutable until the next 00:00 UTC boundary, so it is ed… Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Live"],"parameters":[{"name":"venue","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Market venue for end-of-day. Same coverage as previous close (stocks, crypto, forex, commodities); DEX has no EOD product.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["stocks","crypto","forex","commodities"]},"example":"commodities"},{"name":"symbol","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Symbol, normalized to the venue's canonical form.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"XAUUSD"}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.005"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"s":{"type":"string","description":"Symbol."},"d":{"type":"string","description":"UTC date of the bar, YYYY-MM-DD."},"o":{"type":"number","description":"Open."},"h":{"type":"number","description":"High."},"l":{"type":"number","description":"Low."},"c":{"type":"number","description":"Close."},"v":{"type":"number","description":"Volume as reported by the source (may be 0 for some FX)."},"t":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Bar open time (00:00 UTC), Unix epoch milliseconds."}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/last/quote/{venue}/{symbol}":{"get":{"operationId":"getLastQuote","summary":"Top-of-book quote","description":"Top-of-book quote. Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Live"],"parameters":[{"name":"venue","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Market venue.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["stocks","crypto","forex","commodities"]},"example":"crypto"},{"name":"symbol","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Symbol, normalized to the venue's canonical form.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"BTCUSD"}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.002"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"b":{"type":"string","description":"Bid price."},"B":{"type":"string","description":"Bid size."},"a":{"type":"string","description":"Ask price."},"A":{"type":"string","description":"Ask size."},"t":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/last/signals/{venue}/{symbol}":{"get":{"operationId":"getLiveSignal","summary":"Live technical signal","description":"Live technical signal. Current technical-analysis signal for a stock, FX pair, crypto asset, or commodity: a decision-ready summary (strong_sell to strong_buy) with a score from -1 to +1, plus the oscillator and moving-average indicators behind it, each with its value(s) and vote. Indicators still in warmup are omitted, so the vote counts sum to the rows returned. `price.bar_status` is `forming` when a live tick is folded… Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Signals"],"parameters":[{"name":"venue","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Market venue for technical signals.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["stocks","crypto","forex","commodities"]},"example":"crypto"},{"name":"symbol","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Symbol, normalized to the venue's canonical form.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"BTCUSD"},{"name":"interval","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Bar interval the signal is computed on. Default 1h.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["1m","5m","15m","30m","1h","1d","1w","1mo"],"default":"1h"},"example":"1h"}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.005"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"summary":{"type":"object","properties":{"signal":{"type":"string"},"score":{"type":"number"},"counts":{"type":"object"}}},"oscillators":{"type":"object","description":"One indicator group (oscillators or moving averages) with its own verdict.","properties":{"signal":{"type":"string"},"score":{"type":"number"},"indicators":{"type":"array"}}},"moving_averages":{"type":"object","description":"One indicator group (oscillators or moving averages) with its own verdict.","properties":{"signal":{"type":"string"},"score":{"type":"number"},"indicators":{"type":"array"}}},"price":{"type":"object","properties":{"close":{"type":"number"},"bar_status":{"type":"string"}}}}},"meta":{"type":"object","properties":{"as_of":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"symbol":{"type":"string"},"interval":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/last/trade/{venue}/{symbol}":{"get":{"operationId":"getLastTrade","summary":"Latest trade","description":"Latest trade. Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Live"],"parameters":[{"name":"venue","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Market venue.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["stocks","crypto","forex","commodities"]},"example":"forex"},{"name":"symbol","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Symbol, normalized to the venue's canonical form.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"USDTRY"}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.002"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"s":{"type":"string","description":"Symbol."},"p":{"type":"string","description":"Last trade price."},"P":{"type":"string","description":"Last trade size."},"t":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Unix epoch milliseconds."}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/last/most-active/{venue}":{"get":{"operationId":"getMostActive","summary":"Most active symbols","description":"Most active symbols. The symbols with the highest volume so far in the current trading day (the UTC day for crypto, the regular session for US stocks), highest first. Stocks are ranked by raw volume; crypto by estimated dollar volume (volume times current price), because coin sizes are not comparable across symbols. `meta.ranked_by` says which. Available for stocks and crypto only. Before the first bar of a new day (stock… Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Live"],"parameters":[{"name":"venue","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Market venue.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["stocks","crypto"]},"example":"crypto"},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Number of rows.","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"default":20},"example":20}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.005"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","description":"Highest volume first.","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"symbol":{"type":"string"},"price":{"type":"string"},"day_volume":{"type":"number"},"prev_day_volume":{"type":"number"},"prev_close":{"type":"string"},"change":{"type":"string"},"change_pct":{"type":"number"}}}},"meta":{"type":"object","properties":{"as_of":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"venue":{"type":"string"},"limit":{"type":"integer","description":"Rows in this response at most."},"ranked_by":{"type":"string","enum":["volume","volume_usd"],"description":"volume is raw day volume (stocks); volume_usd is estimated dollar volume (crypto)."}}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/last/movers/{venue}":{"get":{"operationId":"getMovers","summary":"Market movers (top gainers and losers)","description":"Market movers (top gainers and losers). The biggest percentage risers and fallers of a venue, ranked from each symbol's live price against its stored previous close (the same value `/v1/last/close` serves). Change is therefore measured since the last close snapshot. Symbols with no close or no price are skipped and unchanged symbols appear in neither list. Not available for DEX. Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Live"],"parameters":[{"name":"venue","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Market venue for previous close. DEX has no previous-close product; commodities does (unlike the live trade/quote venues).","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["stocks","crypto","forex","commodities"]},"example":"crypto"},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Rows per list (gainers and losers each).","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"default":20},"example":20},{"name":"direction","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Which list to return. `gainers` or `losers` returns only that list (the other key is left out of `data`, which also cuts the payload); `all` or omitted returns both.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["all","gainers","losers"],"default":"all"},"example":"all"}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.005"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"gainers":{"type":"array","description":"Largest percentage increases first. Omitted when `direction=losers`.","items":{"type":"object"}},"losers":{"type":"array","description":"Largest percentage decreases first. Omitted when `direction=gainers`.","items":{"type":"object"}}}},"meta":{"type":"object","properties":{"as_of":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"venue":{"type":"string"},"limit":{"type":"integer","description":"Rows per list in this response."}}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/fnd/economic-calendar":{"get":{"operationId":"getEconomicCalendar","summary":"US economic calendar","description":"US economic calendar. Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["EconomicCalendar"],"parameters":[{"name":"from","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Lower bound (YYYY-MM-DD or RFC3339). Default now.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"to","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Upper bound. Default from + 30 days.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"country","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","default":"US"},"example":"US"},{"name":"impact","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["low","medium","high"]}},{"name":"agency","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["BLS","BEA","Census","Fed","DOL","EIA"]}},{"name":"event_id","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Filter to a recurring event, e.g. `us_cpi`.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":100,"minimum":1,"maximum":500},"example":100}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.005"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"events":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"event_id":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"country":{"type":"string"},"currency":{"type":"string"},"agency":{"type":"string"},"impact":{"type":"string"},"scheduled_at":{"type":"string"},"actual":{"type":["number","null"]},"previous":{"type":["number","null"]},"consensus":{"type":["number","null"]},"released_at":{"type":["string","null"]}}}},"count":{"type":"integer"},"filter":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/fnd/markets":{"get":{"operationId":"listMarkets","summary":"List markets","description":"List markets. Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Markets"],"parameters":[{"name":"region","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Region filter.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["north_america","europe","asia_pacific","latam","global"]}}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.002"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"market":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"type":{"type":"string"},"timezone":{"type":"string"},"region":{"type":"string"},"exchanges":{"type":"array"},"stats":{"type":"object"}}}},"meta":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/fnd/symbols":{"get":{"operationId":"listFundamentalSymbols","summary":"List active instruments (fundamentals alias)","description":"List active instruments (fundamentals alias). Alias of `/v1/symbols`; uses the same filters and response. Search the instrument catalog across stocks, crypto, DEX, forex and commodities. Only active entries are listed. Results are ordered by asset class, symbol and a stable internal tie-breaker. Catalog access has no market entitlement gate, but normal API-key authentication, usage accounting and rate limits still apply.… Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Symbols"],"parameters":[{"name":"asset_class","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Case-insensitive asset-class filter: stocks, crypto, forex or commodities.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["stocks","crypto","forex","commodities"]},"example":"stocks"},{"name":"venue","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Case-insensitive exact match on the catalog row's venue. Use a venue returned by the catalog; unknown values return an empty list.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"q","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Case-insensitive substring search over symbol or name.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"BTC"},{"name":"cursor","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Opaque pagination cursor from a previous response's `meta.next_cursor`.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Page size. Omitted, non-numeric or non-positive values use 50; values above 200 are clamped to 200.","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":200,"default":50},"example":50}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.002"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","description":"Instrument reference metadata. Optional string fields are omitted when unavailable. Catalog status does not establish the availability or freshness of live prices or historical bars.","required":["slug","asset_class","venue","symbol","status","details"],"properties":{"slug":{"type":"string"},"asset_class":{"type":"string"},"venue":{"type":"string"},"market_id":{"type":"string"},"symbol":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"base_asset":{"type":"string"},"quote_asset":{"type":"string"},"currency":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string"},"details":{"type":"object"}}}},"meta":{"type":"object","required":["as_of","count"],"properties":{"as_of":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"Response generation time, not the underlying market data timestamp."},"count":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"description":"Number of entries in this page, not the total catalog size."},"next_cursor":{"type":"string","description":"Opaque cursor for the next page; omitted on the last page."}}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/hist/{venue}/{symbol}/signals":{"get":{"operationId":"getSignalHistory","summary":"Historical technical-signal series","description":"Historical technical-signal series. The technical-analysis signal as a time series, one point per bar: summary, score, close, and any discrete events (golden_cross, death_cross, macd_cross_up, macd_cross_down) that fired on that bar. Same computation as the live signal, so a historical point is identical to the one that fired live. `t` is the bar-open time in Unix epoch milliseconds, the same as the `/v1/hist/*` bars rout… Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Signals"],"parameters":[{"name":"venue","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Market venue for technical signals.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["stocks","crypto","forex","commodities"]},"example":"crypto"},{"name":"symbol","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Symbol, normalized to the venue's canonical form.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"BTCUSD"},{"name":"interval","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Bar interval each point is computed on. Default 1d.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["1m","5m","15m","30m","1h","1d","1w","1mo"],"default":"1d"},"example":"1d"},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Return the most recent N points (newest last).","schema":{"type":"integer","default":100,"maximum":1000},"example":100}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.01"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"t":{"type":"integer"},"close":{"type":"number"},"summary":{"type":"string"},"score":{"type":"number"},"events":{"type":"array"}}}},"meta":{"type":"object","properties":{"as_of":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"symbol":{"type":"string"},"interval":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/convert/{from}/{to}":{"get":{"operationId":"convertAmount","summary":"Convert between forex and crypto at live rates","description":"Convert between forex and crypto at live rates. Converts an amount between any supported forex or crypto symbols at the current mid-market rate. Converting an asset to itself returns rate 1. Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Convert"],"parameters":[{"name":"from","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Source currency or token (e.g. `USD`, `BTC`). Case-insensitive.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"USD"},{"name":"to","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Target currency or token (e.g. `GBP`, `ETH`). Case-insensitive.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"TRY"},{"name":"amount","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Amount to convert. Defaults to 1 (returns just the rate).","schema":{"type":"number","default":1},"example":100}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.002"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"from":{"type":"string","description":"Echo of the source symbol."},"to":{"type":"string","description":"Echo of the target symbol."},"amount":{"type":"number","description":"Amount sent in."},"rate":{"type":"number","description":"Rate applied; amount × rate = result."},"result":{"type":"number","description":"Converted amount."},"t":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Timestamp of the underlying market rate (Unix epoch ms)."}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/symbols/{asset_class}/{symbol}":{"get":{"operationId":"getSymbol","summary":"Get instrument details","description":"Get instrument details. Look up a stock, crypto, forex or commodity catalog entry using its asset class and symbol, for example `/v1/symbols/stocks/AAPL`. The asset class is normalized to lowercase and the symbol to uppercase. Inactive and delisted entries can also be returned. For DEX instruments, use the detail path with a separate chain segment. Normal API-key authentication and usage limits apply; no market entitlemen… Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Symbols"],"parameters":[{"name":"asset_class","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Asset-class segment of the catalog slug; case-insensitive.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["stocks","crypto","forex","commodities"]},"example":"crypto"},{"name":"symbol","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Symbol segment returned by the catalog, normalized to uppercase. Encode this segment separately from the slash-delimited slug.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"BTCUSD"}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.002"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"type":"object","description":"Instrument reference metadata. Optional string fields are omitted when unavailable. Catalog status does not establish the availability or freshness of live prices or historical bars.","required":["slug","asset_class","venue","symbol","status","details"],"properties":{"slug":{"type":"string","description":"Canonical identifier with literal slash separators: asset_class/symbol, or dex/chain/symbol for DEX. Encode segments separately when building a detail URL."},"asset_class":{"type":"string","enum":["stocks","crypto","forex","commodities"]},"venue":{"type":"string","description":"Venue tag stored in the catalog."},"market_id":{"type":"string","description":"Market identifier, when mapped."},"symbol":{"type":"string","description":"Canonical instrument symbol."},"name":{"type":"string"},"base_asset":{"type":"string"},"quote_asset":{"type":"string"},"currency":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["active","inactive","delisted"]},"details":{"type":"object","description":"Asset-specific metadata; an empty object when unavailable.","additionalProperties":true}}},"meta":{"type":"object","required":["as_of"],"properties":{"as_of":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"Response generation time, not the underlying market data timestamp."}}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/snapshot/{venue}":{"get":{"operationId":"getSnapshot","summary":"Full market snapshot (gzip required)","description":"Full market snapshot (gzip required). Requires `Accept-Encoding: gzip`. Returns one entry per symbol the venue currently publishes, or scope it to a watchlist with `symbols`. Not paginated: a snapshot is the complete picture at `meta.as_of`. Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Live"],"parameters":[{"name":"venue","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Market venue.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["stocks","crypto","forex","commodities"]},"example":"forex"},{"name":"symbols","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Comma-separated symbols (up to 250, case-insensitive). Omit to receive the full market. Any malformed symbol rejects the whole request with 400.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"USDTRY,EURTRY,EURUSD"},{"name":"Accept-Encoding","in":"header","required":false,"description":"Recommended: large responses are only served gzip-compressed.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["gzip"]}}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.02"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"s":{"type":"string"},"p":{"type":"string"},"P":{"type":"string"},"b":{"type":"string"},"B":{"type":"string"},"a":{"type":"string"},"A":{"type":"string"},"t":{"type":"integer"}}}},"meta":{"type":"object","properties":{"as_of":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"venue":{"type":"string"},"count":{"type":"integer"}}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request. Not charged."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The PAYMENT-REQUIRED header carries the x402 v2 payment requirements; retry with a PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header."},"404":{"description":"Unknown symbol or route. Not charged."}}}},"/v1/symbols":{"get":{"operationId":"listSymbols","summary":"List active instruments","description":"List active instruments. Search the instrument catalog across stocks, crypto, DEX, forex and commodities. Only active entries are listed. Results are ordered by asset class, symbol and a stable internal tie-breaker. Catalog access has no market entitlement gate, but normal API-key authentication, usage accounting and rate limits still apply. A catalog entry does not guarantee live or historical data availability. Gzip is… Pay per call in USDC via x402; no account or API key.","tags":["Symbols"],"parameters":[{"name":"asset_class","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Case-insensitive asset-class filter: stocks, crypto, forex or commodities.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["stocks","crypto","forex","commodities"]},"example":"stocks"},{"name":"venue","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Case-insensitive exact match on the catalog row's venue. Use a venue returned by the catalog; unknown values return an empty list.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"q","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Case-insensitive substring search over symbol or name.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"BTC"},{"name":"cursor","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Opaque pagination cursor from a previous response's `meta.next_cursor`.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Page size. Omitted, non-numeric or non-positive values use 50; values above 200 are clamped to 200.","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":200,"default":50},"example":50}],"security":[],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.002"},"protocols":[{"x402":{"network":"eip155:8453","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0xDFf9d1671B5B0E91148caf4CDd67a091AF42AAAa"}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success. Charged once; the PAYMENT-RESPONSE header carries the settlement receipt.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","description":"Instrument reference metadata. Optional string fields are omitted when unavailable. Catalog status does not establish the availability or freshness of live prices or historical bars.","required":["slug","asset_class","venue","symbol","status","details"],"properties":{"slug":{"type":"string"},"asset_class":{"type":"string"},"venue":{"type":"string"},"market_id":{"type":"string"},"symbol":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"base_asset":{"type":"string"},"quote_asset":{"type":"string"},"currency":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string"},"details":{"type":"object"}}}},"meta":{"type":"object","required":["as_of","count"],"properties":{"as_of":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"Response generation time, not the underlying market data timestamp."},"count":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"description":"Number of entries in this page, not the total catalog size."},"next_curs